# Full-chain PEMs from the DoD source bundles. Deliberately not published.
#
# These contain issuing CAs and intermediates, not just roots. Shipping them
# next to DoD_Roots.pem in a public repository invites exactly the mistake this
# project exists to prevent: someone installs a "DoD certificate file" and
# promotes a retired issuing CA to a root of trust, at which point that CA can
# validate a certificate directly.
#
# None of them are covered by the signed `.sha256` manifest DoD ships in the
# same directory, so excluding them costs nothing in verifiability -- and
# `tools/refresh_roots.py --verify-sources` still checks every file that is.
DoD_Full_Chain.pem
DoD_Full_Chain_v5_17.pem
DoD_PKE_CA_chain.pem
dod_pke_chain.pem

# Written by the installer: records the tag this checkout is pinned to
.sentinel-ref

